    "text": "Turnto10.com\nwebsite\nSouth Kingstown\nSouth Kingstown councilor accused of assault placed on leave for job at Providence Schools\nBy NBC 10 NEWS,\n2 hours ago(WJAR) — South Kingstown town councilor accused of assault has been place on leave from his full-time job. Jay Wegimont is a communications officer for the Providence Public Schools. South Kingstown police said they have charged him with simple assault in an incident outside the South Kingstown Town Hall.\n1",
